# .claude-context — nutrition-labels repo map (token-optimized)

## Stack
- **Frontend**: React 18 + TypeScript, Vite, Zustand (recipe/saved/prefs/theme), React Query, Tailwind, @react-pdf/renderer (PDF export, lazy-loaded)
- **Backend**: FastAPI + SQLite (read-only, FTS5), slowapi — search + food lookup only, no rendering
- **Infra**: docker-compose — db-init → backend(:8000) + frontend(nginx) behind Caddy TLS

## Tree (essentials)
```
backend/app/{main,config,constants,database,models,nutrition,search}.py
backend/data/build_db_full.py        one-time DB builder (USDA FDC CSVs)
frontend/src/
  utils/{nutrition,units,stepText,id}.ts
