### Stores (Zustand)
- **`recipeStore`** — active recipe; NOT persisted. All ingredient actions key off `instanceId`. Actions: add/remove/updateName/updateAmount/updateUnit (preserves grams)/updatePortion (preserves grams)/moveIngredient; setPortionDivisor/setLabelName/setDimensions/setHighlightedNutrients/setServingHousehold/setAddedSugarsG/setTransFatG (the last two clamp ≥0, NaN→0); step add/update/remove/move; variable add/set/update/remove; clearRecipe/loadRecipe/loadVersion/exitVersionView/setCurrentRecipeId. Internal `withInstanceIds` back-fills legacy persisted rows; `stateFromVersion` back-fills servingHousehold/addedSugarsG/transFatG.
- **`savedRecipesStore`** — `nl_saved_recipes` v2; max 50 recipes × 20 versions. `createRecipe/appendVersion/renameRecipe/deleteRecipe/deleteVersion`.
- **`preferencesStore`** — `nl_preferences`; `recents` (max 15) + `favorites` + `isMethodExpanded`.
- **`themeStore`** — `nl-theme`; ThemeKey: `"paper"|"overcast"|"twilight"|"midnight"`; `useActiveTheme()`, `themeVars(def, accentHex)` → CSS custom props.

